\f2\b0 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\i \cf2 Explanation:
\f2\i0  A magnet pulls out the magnetic iron pins first; pouring the mixture through filter paper then isolates the insoluble sand from water.\
